{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/extras/4d04b4b2f98a2b2936faa86d9c713f31.avif?t=1771011937\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Blue Skies is an exciting and modern take on the classic on-rail adventures of the '90s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar over oceans, desert ridges, and perilous caves, battling waves of enemies and pushing back Grimclaw\u2019s forces. With the help of allies, you\u2019ll fight to restore peace while experiencing the thrill of classic arcade flight-combat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-learn controls make Wild Blue Skies accessible for newcomers and genre veterans alike, while the game\u2019s stunning visuals immerse you in a hand-crafted, anime-style universe. With its compelling gameplay loop, branching paths, and thrilling missions, every flight is an adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/extras/ce8b50aca31e328a8d96f5809882a931.webp?t=1771011937\" width=780 height=23 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/extras/46c3e27b79f573c0dc45418408f1cb1f.webp?t=1771011937\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Experience all the classic on-rails shooter action with new and modernized controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/extras/46c3e27b79f573c0dc45418408f1cb1f.webp?t=1771011937\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Discover a rich and colorful world with stunning vistas at every turn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/extras/46c3e27b79f573c0dc45418408f1cb1f.webp?t=1771011937\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Fly through an action-packed campaign alongside a stalwart squad of allies\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/extras/46c3e27b79f573c0dc45418408f1cb1f.webp?t=1771011937\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Take on exciting boss battles and dogfights against a mysterious rival squad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/extras/46c3e27b79f573c0dc45418408f1cb1f.webp?t=1771011937\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Discover secret paths and missions on your quest to take down the evil Baron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/extras/46c3e27b79f573c0dc45418408f1cb1f.webp?t=1771011937\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Become an ace pilot and master every mission through a simple and challenging score system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/extras/e25a6e7b47763009bf1e666db0e5e1d2.webp?t=1771011937\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1921490?t=1771011937","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921490/6d489fd398f3f23ae5b9cb74a9a1ed30cdb2b1cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771011937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati